  ],
  "solution": "【小问1详解】\n解：如图，△\\(A_{ 1 } B_{ 1 } C_{ 1 }\\)为所作；\n【小问2详解】\n解：如图，\\(\\vartriangle A_{ 2 } B_{ 2 } C_{ 2 }\\)为所作，\\(A_{ 2 } (-8,-2)\\)，\\(B_{ 2 } (-4,-6)\\)，\\(C_{ 2 } (-2,-4)\\)；\n〔图2〕【小问3详解】\n\\(\\vartriangle A_{ 2 } B_{ 2 } C_{ 2 }\\)的面积\\(=6\\times 4-\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\times 2\\times 2-\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\times 2\\times 6-\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\times 4\\times 4=8\\)．",
